#. module: theme_kiddo
#: model_terms:theme.ir.ui.view,arch:theme_kiddo.s_call_to_action
msgid "2,000 parents<br/> brought their kid to our nursery."
msgstr "ພໍ່ແມ່ 2,000 ຄົນ<br/> ໄດ້ພາລູກມາສູນລ້ຽງເດັກຂອງພວກເຮົາ."

#. module: theme_kiddo
#: model_terms:theme.ir.ui.view,arch:theme_kiddo.s_three_columns
msgid ""
"<br/>\n"
"        For every kid"
msgstr ""
"<br/>\n"
"        ສຳລັບເດັກທຸກຄົນ"

#. module: theme_kiddo
#: model_terms:theme.ir.ui.view,arch:theme_kiddo.s_three_columns
msgid ""
"<br/>\n"
"        Open-door policy"
msgstr ""
"<br/>\n"
"        ນະໂຍບາຍເປີດກວ້າງ"

#. module: theme_kiddo
#: model_terms:theme.ir.ui.view,arch:theme_kiddo.s_three_columns
msgid ""
"<br/>\n"
"        Our mission"
msgstr ""
"<br/>\n"
"        ພາລະກິດຂອງພວກເຮົາ"

#. module: theme_kiddo
#: model_terms:theme.ir.ui.view,arch:theme_kiddo.s_banner
msgid "A little place <br/>of paradise"
msgstr "ສະຖານທີ່ນ້ອຍໆ <br/>ແຫ່ງຄວາມສຸກ"

#. module: theme_kiddo
#: model_terms:theme.ir.ui.view,arch:theme_kiddo.s_product_list
msgid "About us"
msgstr "ກ່ຽວກັບພວກເຮົາ"

#. module: theme_kiddo
#: model_terms:theme.ir.ui.view,arch:theme_kiddo.s_image_text
msgid "Activities"
msgstr "ກິດຈະກຳ"

#. module: theme_kiddo
#: model_terms:theme.ir.ui.view,arch:theme_kiddo.s_three_columns
msgid ""
"All activities are planned to meet each child’s individual needs. This "
"approach will help your child to develop to the best of their ability."
msgstr ""
"ທຸກກິດຈະກຳໄດ້ຮັບການວາງແຜນໃຫ້ສອດຄ່ອງກັບຄວາມຕ້ອງການຂອງເດັກແຕ່ລະຄົນ. ວິທີນີ້ຈະຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ລູກຂອງທ່ານມີການ"
"ພັດທະນາຢ່າງເຕັມຄວາມສາມາດ."

#. module: theme_kiddo
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_theme_kiddo
msgid ""
"Banner hero opens onto an activities text-image section and three service-"
"pillar columns with mixed image-shape crops (solid blob, organic-outlined "
"frame, rounded-square), then a services icon grid and a CTA, with floating "
"and connection line motifs across the content rows. Warm and service-"
"storytelling driven / suited for nurseries, childcare centers, kids activity "
"programs, and family-oriented education services"
msgstr ""
"ແຖບປ້າຍຫຼັກເປີດໄປສູ່ພາກສ່ວນຂໍ້ຄວາມ-ຮູບພາບກິດຈະກຳ ແລະ ສາມຖັນບໍລິການຫຼັກ ພ້ອມຮູບຊົງທີ່ຫຼາກຫຼາຍ (ຮູບຢອດສີ"
"ທຶບ, ຂອບຮູບແບບທຳມະຊາດ, ສີ່ແຈມົນ), ຕາມດ້ວຍຕາໜ່າງໄອຄອນການບໍລິການ ແລະ ປຸ່ມກະຕຸ້ນໃຫ້ດຳເນີນການ, ພ້"
"ອມລວດລາຍເສັ້ນເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຕະຫຼອດແຖວເນື້ອຫາ. ໃຫ້ຄວາມອົບອຸ່ນ ແລະ ເນັ້ນເລົ່າເລື່ອງລາວການບໍລິການ / ເໝາະສຳລັ"
"ບສູນລ້ຽງເດັກ, ສູນດູແລເດັກ, ໂຄງການກິດຈະກຳເດັກ ແລະ ການບໍລິການການສຶກສາສຳລັບຄອບຄົວ"

#. module: theme_kiddo
#: model_terms:theme.ir.ui.view,arch:theme_kiddo.s_call_to_action
msgid "Contact us"
msgstr "ຕິດຕໍ່ພວກເຮົາ"

#. module: theme_kiddo
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:theme_kiddo.field_theme_utils__display_name
msgid "Display Name"
msgstr "ຊື່ສະແດງ"

#. module: theme_kiddo
#: model_terms:theme.ir.ui.view,arch:theme_kiddo.s_call_to_action
msgid "Entrust us with your children and go to work with peace of mind"
msgstr "ມອບຄວາມໄວ້ວາງໃຈໃຫ້ພວກເຮົາເບິ່ງແຍງລູກຂອງທ່ານ ແລ້ວໄປເຮັດວຽກໄດ້ຢ່າງສະບາຍໃຈ"

#. module: theme_kiddo
#: model_terms:theme.ir.ui.view,arch:theme_kiddo.s_product_list
msgid "Events"
msgstr "ງານກິດຈະກຳ"

#. module: theme_kiddo
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:theme_kiddo.field_theme_utils__id
msgid "ID"
msgstr "ລະຫັດ"

#. module: theme_kiddo
#: model:ir.module.module,shortdesc:base.module_theme_kiddo
msgid "Kiddo Theme"
msgstr "ຮູບແບບ Kiddo"

#. module: theme_kiddo
#: model:ir.module.module,summary:base.module_theme_kiddo
msgid "Nursery, Toys, Games, Kids, Boys, Girls, Stores"
msgstr "ສູນລ້ຽງເດັກ, ເຄື່ອງຫຼິ້ນ, ເກມ, ເດັກນ້ອຍ, ເດັກຊາຍ, ເດັກຍິງ, ຮ້ານຄ້າ"

#. module: theme_kiddo
#: model_terms:theme.ir.ui.view,arch:theme_kiddo.s_three_columns
msgid ""
"Our aim is to make the early years of your child’s life as enjoyable, "
"rewarding and positive as possible."
msgstr ""
"ເປົ້າໝາຍຂອງພວກເຮົາແມ່ນເຮັດໃຫ້ຊ່ວງໄວເດັກຂອງລູກທ່ານ ເຕັມໄປດ້ວຍຄວາມມ່ວນຊື່ນ, ມີຄຸນຄ່າ ແລະ ສ້າງສັນທີ່ສຸດ"
"ເທົ່າທີ່ຈະເປັນໄປໄດ້."

#. module: theme_kiddo
#: model_terms:theme.ir.ui.view,arch:theme_kiddo.s_banner
msgid ""
"Our goal is to create a safe and nurturing environment for your child to "
"learn and grow. We believe that every child is unique and should be treated "
"as such."
msgstr ""
"ເປົ້າໝາຍຂອງພວກເຮົາແມ່ນສ້າງສະພາບແວດລ້ອມທີ່ປອດໄພ ແລະ ອົບອຸ່ນ ເພື່ອໃຫ້ລູກຂອງທ່ານໄດ້ຮຽນຮູ້ ແລະ ເຕີບໃຫ"
"ຍ່. ພວກເຮົາເຊື່ອວ່າເດັກທຸກຄົນມີຄວາມພິເສດສະເພາະຕົວ ແລະ ຄວນໄດ້ຮັບການດູແລຢ່າງເໝາະສົມ."

#. module: theme_kiddo
#: model_terms:theme.ir.ui.view,arch:theme_kiddo.s_product_list
msgid "Our team"
msgstr "ທີມງານຂອງພວກເຮົາ"

#. module: theme_kiddo
#: model_terms:theme.ir.ui.view,arch:theme_kiddo.s_image_text
msgid "Our team is composed of experienced nursery nurses."
msgstr "ທີມງານຂອງພວກເຮົາປະກອບດ້ວຍພະຍາບານ ແລະ ຜູ້ລ້ຽງເດັກທີ່ມີປະສົບການ."

#. module: theme_kiddo
#: model_terms:theme.ir.ui.view,arch:theme_kiddo.s_product_list
msgid "Playground"
msgstr "ເດີ່ນຫຼິ້ນ"

#. module: theme_kiddo
#: model:ir.model,name:theme_kiddo.model_theme_utils
msgid "Theme Utils"
msgstr "ເຄື່ອງມືຮູບແບບ"

#. module: theme_kiddo
#: model_terms:theme.ir.ui.view,arch:theme_kiddo.s_image_text
msgid ""
"They will propose to your children educational activities, playful, varied "
"and adapted to the stage of development."
msgstr ""
"ພວກເຂົາຈະນຳສະເໜີກິດຈະກຳການສຶກສາທີ່ມ່ວນຊື່ນ, ຫຼາກຫຼາຍ ແລະ ເໝາະສົມກັບແຕ່ລະໄວການຈະເລີນເຕີບໂຕໃຫ້ແກ່"
"ລູກຂອງທ່ານ."

#. module: theme_kiddo
#: model_terms:theme.ir.ui.view,arch:theme_kiddo.s_product_list
msgid "Visit us"
msgstr "ມາຢ້ຽມຢາມພວກເຮົາ"

#. module: theme_kiddo
#: model_terms:theme.ir.ui.view,arch:theme_kiddo.s_three_columns
msgid ""
"You are welcome to come and see the nursery and meet the team at any time "
"convenient to you."
msgstr ""
"ພວກເຮົາຍິນດີຕ້ອນຮັບທ່ານເຂົ້າມາຢ້ຽມຊົມສູນລ້ຽງເດັກ ແລະ ພົບປະກັບທີມງານໄດ້ທຸກເວລາທີ່ທ່ານສະດວກ."

